1
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:14,540
I was born in a small village.

2
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:21,660
When I was young, foreign soldiers took over my village.

3
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:26,660
I was torn from the adults and had their language forced into me.

4
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:30,880
With every shift in the war, the rulers changed,

5
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:33,940
and each time, I was made to speak a different tongue.

6
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:38,540
As the language changed, so did I.

7
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:44,220
My personality, my thinking, my sense of right and wrong.

8
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:48,870
Language kills.

9
00:00:48,870 --> 00:00:53,550
That country was dominated time and again by the languages of other nations.

10
00:00:53,550 --> 00:00:56,870
Because of that, while still a child,

11
00:00:56,870 --> 00:00:58,630
he lost the foundation of his mother tongue.

12
00:00:58,630 --> 00:01:04,310
His country, his family, his face — every proof of his existence was taken from him.

13
00:01:04,310 --> 00:01:08,270
All that was left to him was a skull.

14
00:01:08,270 --> 00:01:50,260
When people unite under a single will,

15
00:01:50,260 --> 00:01:53,940
they unleash a far greater power.

16
00:01:53,940 --> 00:01:56,500
A single will —

17
00:01:56,500 --> 00:01:59,490
that means a ruler.

18
00:01:59,490 --> 00:02:03,020
Rulers use language

19
00:02:03,020 --> 00:02:04,560
to unite their people.

20
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:08,580
The world becomes one.

21
00:02:08,580 --> 00:02:10,560
The key to that has been found.

22
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:15,660
No longer will race, ethnicity, borders, or faces need to change.

23
00:02:15,660 --> 00:02:19,540
People will be connected through a new form of communication.

24
00:02:19,540 --> 00:02:23,340
The world The Boss envisioned will finally be within our grasp.

25
00:02:23,340 --> 00:03:23,220
America — the land of freedom.

26
00:03:23,220 --> 00:03:35,520
What the Major sought there was information, language,

27
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:38,830
a system to control the unconscious mind.

28
00:03:41,710 --> 00:03:44,150
What parasitizes the world is not an insect.

29
00:03:44,150 --> 00:03:45,610
It is language.

30
00:03:45,610 --> 00:03:47,950
Language sustains the world,

31
00:03:47,950 --> 00:03:50,210
sustains civilization.

32
00:03:50,210 --> 00:03:51,950
Not people, not nations —

33
00:03:51,950 --> 00:03:54,480
by killing language itself,

34
00:03:54,480 --> 00:03:57,110
I will free the world from domination.

35
00:03:57,110 --> 00:04:06,320
I will eradicate English — the language that has enslaved the world.

36
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:11,780
Lose English as a common tongue, and the world will fracture.

37
00:04:12,700 --> 00:05:36,480
And the world will be free — united through retribution.

38
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:38,920
That is what Zero said.
